Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:07.50,SevenCloudsIntro,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}yung kai - blue (Lyrics)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:25.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Your morning eyes\NI could stare like watching stars
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:32.60,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I could walk you by\NAnd I'll tell without a thought you'd be mine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:39.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Would you mind if I took your hand tonight?\NKnow you're all that I want this life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:46.80,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I'll imagine we fell in love\NI'll nap under moonlight skies with you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:54.00,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I think I'll picture us, you with the waves\NThe ocean's colors on your face
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.50,0:01:01.40,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I'll leave my heart with your air\NSo let me fly with you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.80,0:01:14.20,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Will you be forever with me?\NCause you're so blue
